        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0571" n="475" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg475"/>

                <head>No. 282.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Schenck to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 5, 1873</date>.
                        (Received August 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 467.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Parliament was prorogued to-day. I send
                    herewith a copy of the Queen’s speech, delivered on the occasion by lords
                    commissioners. You will find nothing adverted to in it of any special interest
                    to the United States.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>ROBT. C. SCHENCK.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d284-a1.xml" xpointer="d284-a1"/>
            </div>
